    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9d47390e608b13fd2cef751",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "资深训练员A",
      "source_fingerprint": "c562a69cc80221d7226c73b0d8845c937fe686b8cb2fc46366892017d0bd14c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5afb9743d5fa87e849c2244c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞……真可惜的孩子啊。虽然说是『她自己的问题』，\r\n但原因还是她性格上不好争胜负吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caa47b580e13af763a250dc1db2085dd1156e2e6e31cf7b4d077d8b1a6801adb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:582a77aba5395f7f13e2278e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新人训练员A",
      "source_fingerprint": "e829f9d4dc056512054ee3af7d16ee643fea041192ab34f55f5b5f4bdc406a95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba73c7180ab88100a4993148",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你是说因为她性格稳重而随和，所以不想出道\r\n去和其他孩子竞争吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86129b3945d0741b35fa8c05f6dbb8342eae89f305d0be44396bc35b2d2ef94a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:115d99ab1c933e093102ec0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新人训练员A",
      "source_fingerprint": "e829f9d4dc056512054ee3af7d16ee643fea041192ab34f55f5b5f4bdc406a95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011003.json",
      "json_path": [
