      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是这样吗？　辛苦了。\n我，还要去再跑一会儿呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ef713ab28e835d09038724a464e1bbc84b7ce9d9eff8c043fc79633b2c9ddf2",
